     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Thanks Rui!<div><br></div><div>We occasionally (every week or two) tweet (none of us are major twitter people!) about a nimble use case.</div><div><br></div><div>Our two most recent were your paper (<a href=\"https://twitter.com/R_nimble/status/1225830992935448576\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://twitter.com/R_nimble/status/1225830992935448576&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792478187523000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0PrPgAHG_kLXvQc8wiK8Bw\">https://twitter.com/R_nimble/status/1225830992935448576</a>) and Andrew&#39;s paper (<a href=\"https://twitter.com/R_nimble/status/1229464520529080320\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://twitter.com/R_nimble/status/1229464520529080320&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792478187523000&amp;usg=AOvVaw29a-QJOu6F3MnXkWzdFmkp\">https://twitter.com/R_nimble/status/1229464520529080320</a>).</div><div><br></div></div><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"></div>"
    ],
    [
     3,
     "<div class=\"gmail_quote\"><div dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gmail_attr\">On Wed, Feb 19, 2020 at 11:54 PM Rui Martins &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">ruicost...@gmail.com</a>&gt; wrote:<br></div></div>"
    ],
    [
     3,
     "<div class=\"gmail_quote\"><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0.8ex;border-left:1px solid rgb(204,204,204);padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div>Hi nimble community,</div><div><br></div><div>thanks for the information about new examples using nimble.<br></div><div>If you allow me, I will add another one:<br></div><div>A paper considering joint models with spatial random-effects is available from here:</div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><h1><span>Improving teeth aesthetics using a spatially shared-parameters model for independent regular lattices</span></h1><span></span><ul><li>\r\n<a href=\"https://doi.org/10.1080/02664763.2020.1724273\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://doi.org/10.1080/02664763.2020.1724273&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792478187523000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0TYjwz97Jb_vIjNWopuY00\">https://doi.org/10.1080/02664763.2020.1724273</a></li></ul><div>Thanks</div><div>Rui<br></div></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><br>segunda-feira, 17 de Fevereiro de 2020 às 17:51:57 UTC, pdevalpine escreveu:<blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0.8ex;border-left:1px solid rgb(204,204,204);padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\">Thanks Andrew.  That&#39;s great to see.<div><br></div><div>(Unfortunately the University of California is in a massive conflict with Elsevier; <a href=\"https://osc.universityofcalifornia.edu/uc-publisher-relationships/uc-and-elsevier/\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://osc.universityofcalifornia.edu/uc-publisher-relationships/uc-and-elsevier/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792478187523000&amp;usg=AOvVaw00PLnlmghLezymtB55Tgne\">https://osc.universityofcalifornia.edu/uc-publisher-relationships/uc-and-elsevier/</a>).</div><div><br></div><div>-Perry</div></div><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"><div dir=\"ltr\">On Sat, Feb 15, 2020 at 8:01 AM Lawson, Andrew B. &lt;<a rel=\"nofollow\">laws...@musc.edu</a>&gt; wrote:<br></div><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0.8ex;border-left:1px solid rgb(204,204,204);padding-left:1ex\">\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div>\r\n<font size=\"2\" face=\"Calibri\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\">\r\n<div>Hi All</div>\r\n<div>Following Perry&#39;s note about the Nimble article I thought I should also mention </div>\r\n<div>the tutorial article published by Spatial and Spatio Temporal Epidemiology (Elsevier)</div>\r\n<div><i>Lawson A. B. (2020)</i><i> </i><i>Nimble for Bayesian Disease Mapping </i></div>\r\n<div> </div>\r\n<div>Available from </div>\r\n<div><a href=\"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/abs/pii/S1877584520300010\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/abs/pii/S1877584520300010&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792478187523000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1ua5uEaelxYD92b07Al54i\"><font color=\"#0563C1\"><u>https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/abs/pii/S1877584520300010</u></font></a></div>\r\n<div> </div>\r\n<div>For anyone interested in Nimble applications in disease mapping.</div>\r\n<div> </div>\r\n<div>best</div>\r\n<div>Andrew</div>\r\n<div> </div>\r\n<div>Division of Biostatistics and Bioinformatics</div>\r\n<div>Department of Public Health Sciences</div>\r\n<div>Medical University of South Carolina</div>\r\n<div>Charleston</div>\r\n<div>29425</div>\r\n<div>South Carolina</div>\r\n<div>USA</div>\r\n<div>ph: <a href=\"tel:(843)%20876-1865\" value=\"+18438761865\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">843-876-1865</a></div>\r\n<div> </div>\r\n<div> </div>\r\n<div>new 3rd edition of BDM book:</div>\r\n<div> </div>\r\n<div><a href=\"http://www.crcpress.com/9781138575424\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.crcpress.com/9781138575424&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792478187523000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1nUkDkRvb3_T03xBnu5OP0\"><font color=\"#0563C1\"><u>www.crcpress.com/9781138575424</u></font></a> </div>\r\n<div> </div>\r\n<div>Handbook of Spatial Epidemiology:</div>\r\n<div> </div>\r\n<div><a href=\"http://www.crcpress.com/9781482253016\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.crcpress.com/9781482253016&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792478187523000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0qe8zWO6vJ8kEgmWXMs9X7\"><font color=\"#0563C1\"><u>www.crcpress.com/9781482253016</u></font></a></div>\r\n<div> </div>\r\n<div> </div>\r\n<div> </div>\r\n<div> </div>\r\n<div> </div>\r\n</span></font>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p></p>\r\n\r\n-- <br>\r\nYou received this message because you are subscribed to the Google Groups &quot;nimble-users&quot; group.<br>\r\nTo unsubscribe from this group and stop receiving emails from it, send an email to <a rel=\"nofollow\">nimble...@googlegroups.com</a>.<br>\r\nTo view this discussion on the web visit <a href=\"https://groups.google.com/d/msgid/nimble-users/BN8PR11MB3636C3A653AE605D78FCC637A3140%40BN8PR11MB3636.namprd11.prod.outlook.com?utm_medium=email&amp;utm_source=footer\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/d/msgid/nimble-users/BN8PR11MB3636C3A653AE605D78FCC637A3140%2540BN8PR11MB3636.namprd11.prod.outlook.com?utm_medium%3Demail%26utm_source%3Dfooter&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792478187523000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3KcLl0LEX1jG2doaPciAvS\">https://groups.google.com/d/msgid/nimble-users/BN8PR11MB3636C3A653AE605D78FCC637A3140%40BN8PR11MB3636.namprd11.prod.outlook.com</a>.<br>\r\n</blockquote></div>\r\n</blockquote></div>\r\n\r\n<p></p>\r\n\r\n-- <br>\r\nYou received this message because you are subscribed to the Google Groups &quot;nimble-users&quot; group.<br></blockquote></div>"
